Date: Wed, 13 May 2026 10:30:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?iOS:=20headless=20WSI=20=E2=80=94=20synthetic?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=201024x768=20@=2060Hz=20monitor?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

iPhone has no NSScreen/CGDirectDisplay; previously WSI returned all
NULLs and IDXGIAdapter::EnumOutputs returned DXGI_ERROR_NOT_FOUND.
Games then crashed sampling vtable[7] (GetDesc) on a NULL output.

Implement a single synthetic HMONITOR with "\\.\DISPLAY1" name,
0,0,1024,768 desktop coords, and one mode (1024x768 @ 60Hz / 32bpp /
non-interlaced). Window-side fullscreen ops (setWindowMode /
enterFullscreen / leaveFullscreen / restoreDisplayMode) return
no-op-success since there's nothing to switch on a fixed display;
getWindowMonitor returns the synthetic monitor.

Matches Wine's sysparams_ios.c + driver_ios.c which advertise
1024x768. Also adds build-arm64ec-win.txt meson cross-file used to
produce the ARM64EC PE DLLs that Wine loads on iOS.

Madeira-commit: 88d032664df3e9fc3c145d31e6710a6135e8f0d2
Rebased: clean
Class: madeira-port
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-09-24-dxmt-latest-rebase.md
